# Alembic Commands

## Generate Alembic Migrations Scripts

- Generate an alembic migration file by automatically detecting changes in the SQLAlchemy models with `alembic revision --autogenerate -m "<<your message here>>"`.
- Generate a blank migration file with `alembic revision -m "<<your message here>>"`

## Applying Alembic Migration Script

Apply the migration scripts with 

```
alembic upgrade head
```

## Downgrade Changes

Downgrade the revisions with `alembic downgrade -n` where `n` is the number of revisions you want to go back by.

This will run the downgrades in each script.

```
alembic downgrade -1
```
